title: "Offline Game Revival"
abstract: "An agent skill for turning shut-down mobile games into offline, playable preservation builds, with local tools for recovering lost game data from players' screenshots and screen recordings, time-travel tests for fake servers, and a night-shift skill for unattended overnight runs."
